                arch_report_src_pot_title: 'Zones with archaeological potential',
                arch_report_src_pot_desc: 'The bubbles returned by the “archaeological potential” layer: the same dense score field and variable-radius bubbles displayed by that layer, computed for the report’s centre and selected radius from the RAN/CIMEC sites, density, distance and triangle quality.',
